  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-A 709.01 Proceedings. Any adjudicative proceedings, including hearings that are necessary to resolve any contested issue relative to an IDIP or WIDIP provider or a certified IDIP or WIDIP instructor, shall be conducted pursuant to He-C 200.\n\nSource. #6653, EMERGENCY, eff 12-12-97, EXPIRED 4-11-98\n\nNew. #6753, eff 5-20-98; ss by #8624, INTERIM, eff 5-20-06, EXPIRES: 11-16-06; ss by #8749, eff 11-16-06",
